CloudBurrow patch 2 of 3 to the Cloud Spanner emulator v1.5.58
(GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator, commit
a081a7e71aba5f4d05fc8c6b21ef1a269dcbac28, Apache-2.0).

Upstream files: backend/query/feature_filter/gsql_supported_functions.cc,
backend/query/analyzer_options.cc, backend/query/query_engine.cc.

Why (cloudburrow/cloudburrow#2029): Spanner Graph documents these, and
GoogleSQL's reference evaluator implements them, but the emulator refused
them:
- PROPERTY_EXISTS, ALL_DIFFERENT, SAME, IS SOURCE OF and IS DESTINATION OF
  (graph-operators page) were missing from the emulator's list of supported
  GoogleSQL functions ("Unsupported built-in function: PROPERTY_EXISTS").
  Their GoogleSQL names are property_exists, all_different, same,
  $is_source_node and $is_dest_node.
- ANY CHEAPEST and an edge pattern's COST (graph-patterns page) need
  FEATURE_SQL_GRAPH_CHEAPEST_PATH, which the emulator did not enable ("Cost
  definition is not supported"). It is enabled in both places the emulator
  builds its analyzer options.

diff --git a/backend/query/analyzer_options.cc b/backend/query/analyzer_options.cc
index 328696f..425d86f 100644
--- a/backend/query/analyzer_options.cc
+++ b/backend/query/analyzer_options.cc
@@ -105,6 +105,8 @@ googlesql::LanguageOptions MakeGoogleSqlLanguageOptions() {
       googlesql::FEATURE_SQL_GRAPH_DYNAMIC_ELEMENT_TYPE,
       googlesql::FEATURE_SQL_GRAPH_RETURN_EXTENSIONS,
       googlesql::FEATURE_SQL_GRAPH_CALL,
+      // CloudBurrow (#2029): ANY CHEAPEST and edge COST, as Spanner serves.
+      googlesql::FEATURE_SQL_GRAPH_CHEAPEST_PATH,
       googlesql::FEATURE_UUID_TYPE,
       googlesql::FEATURE_FOR_UPDATE,
       googlesql::FEATURE_INLINE_LAMBDA_ARGUMENT,
diff --git a/backend/query/feature_filter/gsql_supported_functions.cc b/backend/query/feature_filter/gsql_supported_functions.cc
index a544852..1e0be53 100644
--- a/backend/query/feature_filter/gsql_supported_functions.cc
+++ b/backend/query/feature_filter/gsql_supported_functions.cc
@@ -278,6 +278,12 @@ const absl::flat_hash_set<absl::string_view>* SupportedGoogleSQLFunctions() {
         "destination_node_id",
         "path_first",
         "path_last",
+        // CloudBurrow (#2029): Spanner Graph's documented predicates.
+        "property_exists",
+        "all_different",
+        "same",
+        "$is_source_node",
+        "$is_dest_node",
         "new_uuid",
           // clang-format on
       };
diff --git a/backend/query/query_engine.cc b/backend/query/query_engine.cc
index fcf8206..b387b66 100644
--- a/backend/query/query_engine.cc
+++ b/backend/query/query_engine.cc
@@ -185,6 +185,9 @@ absl::StatusOr<googlesql::AnalyzerOptions> MakeAnalyzerOptionsWithParameters(
       googlesql::FEATURE_SQL_GRAPH_DYNAMIC_LABEL_PROPERTIES_IN_DDL);
   options.mutable_language()->EnableLanguageFeature(
